msgid "Add Date Prefix"
msgstr "加上日期前綴"

msgid "Add date prefix to file names (YYYY-MM-DD)"
msgstr "在檔名前加上日期前綴（YYYY-MM-DD）"

msgid "Configure how your files should be renamed."
msgstr "設定上傳檔案的重新命名方式。"

msgid "File Renamer"
msgstr "檔案重新命名"

msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "一般設定"

msgid "Name every uploaded file after its upload time (YYYY-MM-DD-HHMMSS)"
msgstr "所有上傳檔案一律以上傳時間命名（YYYY-MM-DD-HHMMSS）"

msgid "Smart File Renamer Settings"
msgstr "智慧檔案重新命名設定"

msgid "The file keeps its sanitized name with the upload date in front of it: today-news.jpg becomes 2026-09-04-today-news.jpg, which keeps a large media library in chronological order. Ignored when time-based file names are on, since those already start with the date."
msgstr "檔案會保留清理後的檔名，並在前面加上上傳日期：today-news.jpg 會變成 2026-09-04-today-news.jpg，有助於讓龐大的媒體庫依時間排序。啟用時間流水號檔名時此設定會被略過，因為流水號檔名本身已經以日期開頭。"

msgid "The media library title keeps the name the file was uploaded under, so files stay searchable by their original name. This replaces the whole file name, so the date prefix below is not applied on top of it."
msgstr "媒體庫中的標題仍會保留上傳時的原始檔名，因此仍可用原始檔名搜尋到檔案。此模式會取代整個檔名，因此下方的日期前綴不會再疊加上去。"

msgid "Time-Based File Names"
msgstr "時間流水號檔名"
